msgid "Quarkus extension for Spring Cache API"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"While users are encouraged to use xref:cache.adoc[Quarkus annotations for "
"caching], Quarkus nevertheless provides a compatibility layer for Spring "
"Cache annotations in the form of the `spring-cache` extension."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide explains how a Quarkus application can leverage the well known "
"Spring Cache annotations to enable application data caching for their Spring "
"beans."
msgstr ""

